  "bodyHash": "930c6a518a9e2ad4",
  "content": "Привет мир<div style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/fRhZ88L5/no-ofndo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1108\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a255b953-62ec-43d7-b4b3-8a1a94b36bac.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_7238dacb-7d9b-4a20-bbd7-b4fb918fb938.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_d108d080-9787-40f4-9eab-b5a715e7826b.png\" alt=\"\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_1b32b3dd-8aa3-4fa4-b6f4-d7c186884e91.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>伙伴！</strong> 是一款添加10种可驯服生物的模组，每个生物都有特殊能力、具有独特技能的敌对生物、新武器、Boss以及更多内容。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1.19.2和1.21.1版本的模组即将推出</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: verdana;\">推荐安装<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">JEI</a></strong>（此模组兼容JEI），用于查看游戏内所有物品的合成配方。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>可以使用通过击杀敌对生物获得的<strong>小精华</strong>和<strong>大精华</strong>来治愈伙伴。由伙伴召唤出的同伴无法被治愈。所有伙伴都有三种状态：游荡、坐下和跟随玩家。对于召唤出的同伴，你可以选择它们是跟随伙伴还是跟随玩家。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>该模组<strong>高度可配置</strong>，可通过配置文件进行调整。如有任何疑问、问题、贡献或关于内容/模组的新想法，您可以加入我们的<a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">官方Discord</a>并在相应的频道中留言。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/qqm8w127/blocks.png\" width=\"544\" height=\"270\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>大圣杯</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_bbb2f55d-6b7d-4c94-a72b-9838dbafb8f4.gif\" width=\"291\" height=\"287\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;制作方式类似于制作坩埚，但使用铜锭。可以通过交互使用<em>大精华</em>或<em>小精华</em>填充此方块，两者都通过击杀怪物获得。当完全装满时，你可以用其填充一个<em>“空圣杯”</em>，从而获得已填充的圣杯，这是某些配方所需的物品。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>灵魂熔炉</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_e390916e-ce0f-4e0e-ad3a-781d3a5f23df.png\" width=\"172\" height=\"178\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;这个特殊的熔炉可以通过在其顶部放置圣杯并填充它来激活。它可以烹饪不同的东西使其进入类似灵魂的状态，例如将大面包烹饪成奇怪的羊角面包“蛋”？这有什么用呢……</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>青蛙嘉年华</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_008dab43-e2c6-4b08-bb1c-c79222a2c711.png\" width=\"197\" height=\"282\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;一个青蛙形状的嘉年华。我发誓它的形状让我想起了某样东西……可惜没有任何颜色奖励，因为如果是红色的话我会毫不犹豫地投入全部。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>电压柱</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_91e5f972-543d-4e4f-806f-90741283eba3.png\" width=\"123\" height=\"191\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;特斯拉网络组件之一。它在相同高度的柱子列之间产生持续的电流。不建议触摸它，因为它携带高电流，会对它不喜欢的一切进行电击。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>召回平台</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_5f00f534-f2d1-4434-acfa-9e6449bfc5c3.png\" width=\"206\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;特斯拉网络的另一个组件。这是一个传送平台，仅允许在同一特斯拉网络内的两个平台之间旅行。换句话说，你将无法传送到另一个网络中的召回平台。这旨在作为快速旅行的“直观”替代方案，因为完全自动化的传送（或移动）系统往往会使玩家过于简单化。这会破坏游戏（和模组包）预期的复杂性和精神。毕竟，乐趣在于旅程，而不是拥有一切。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>电压继电器</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_fad396d0-85d7-49eb-bae2-a14f6f70599e.png\" width=\"151\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;特斯拉网络的组件之一。它为连接的节点生成（并延长）临时电流。类似于红石中继器。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>等离子灯</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_dbaf3cd0-3fe3-4425-82ce-d0a516efcf4d.png\" width=\"170\" height=\"211\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;特斯拉网络的另一个组件。当连接到电流时会发光。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>特斯拉线圈</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_c441f541-8d4a-4896-a711-30b1f2c124cf.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;特斯拉网络的又一个组件。它为连接的节点生成临时电流。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>重生图腾</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_19afc033-114d-42de-b6f7-c83ebe19d885.png\" width=\"191\" height=\"277\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;一种可使用模组Boss掉落的物品制作的重生图腾，详见下文。它有几种用途。最值得注意的是，它可以作为重生信标：与沙漏交互时，图腾激活并允许一定半径内的所有驯服实体复活有限次数。这是一个<strong>共享</strong>充能池，不是每个实体单独计算，因此你不能无限复活实体。此外，它们复活时只有1点生命值，所以不要把图腾放在战场中央很重要。重生图腾还可以通过与<em>旧布</em>和<em>遗迹黄金</em>交互分别召唤斗篷和曼克。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>空木偶</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_49857d33-f4a0-49b3-b07f-f80c4350c370.png\" width=\"207\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;一个空木偶，其唯一目的是交给驯服的魔法手套以获得木偶，即伙伴之一。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>阴影巨口祭坛</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_3973f3d9-b511-4c45-9d6f-b5d77dcdb238.png\" width=\"168\" height=\"208\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;召唤阴影巨口的祭坛。必须填充结晶血才能激活。如果充满电荷，第一次召唤将进入血液状态，增强其属性。要开始召唤，必须通过简单交互将阴影铃铛链接到祭坛。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>阴影剑祭坛</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_4a8caaab-aad9-4d07-a60d-1aeb73a073fc.png\" width=\"176\" height=\"261\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;召唤阴影剑的祭坛。必须填充结晶血才能激活。如果充满电荷，第一次召唤将进入血液状态，增强其属性。要开始召唤，必须通过简单交互将阴影铃铛链接到祭坛。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/RCcKXQcd/Untitled-2.png\" width=\"478\" height=\"297\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>沙漏</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_52872289-f04f-49e0-86f1-50d85190936c.gif\" width=\"129\" height=\"129\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>沙漏</strong>是一种用精华和其他物品制作的神奇物品。它的主要目的是改变驯服蚁狮的状态。它也可以被消耗以激活重生图腾，根据剩余电荷数量，允许附近驯服的实体在其激活半径内复活。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>蚁狮毛皮</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_e49b258c-27e1-41c4-994e-4fb0973e6af7.png\" width=\"134\" height=\"134\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">一种摸起来<em>不舒服</em>且会燃烧的头毛。说实话我不会吃它，尽管它有时会提供额外的力量，但咀嚼时往往会灼烧你的嘴巴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>大面包</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_b055f433-fdcc-4cb0-87cd-d8f77e2c9bc3.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>大面包</strong>是一种相当奇特的物品。它必须在灵魂熔炉中烹饪，由含有人工生命体的面包制成。烹饪后会产生羊角面包蛋，短时间内孵化成羊角面包龙。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>羊角面包龙原版盔甲</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_c139021b-cbdd-4a55-a8cd-d2fb487b7b00.png\" width=\"126\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p><strong>原版盔甲</strong>用于驯服的羊角面包龙。触摸奶油蛋糕赋予<strong>抗性</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>羊角面包龙巧克力盔甲</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_ed7b99e0-848a-4369-b6d4-2c36367cd404.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>巧克力盔甲</strong>用于驯服的羊角面包龙。触摸奶油蛋糕赋予<strong>速度</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>羊角面包龙草莓盔甲</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_bf8f8c65-3de1-41d2-a4ff-9c0ac7f01b3e.png\" width=\"126\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>草莓盔甲</strong>用于驯服的羊角面包龙。触摸奶油蛋糕赋予<strong>再生</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>人工生命体</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_66994f7f-f647-47b2-a268-ec18f9b1096a.png\" width=\"119\" height=\"119\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>人工生命体</strong>是炼金术士留下的残余碎片，是一种生命奇迹，惩罚任何敢于触碰它的物体。它是一种可在配方中使用的可制作物品。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>羊角面包蛋</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_96e16dd3-e459-4c24-8de6-ad0b2ed21ed3.png\" width=\"126\" height=\"126\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>它<strong>必须</strong>放在<strong>地上</strong>才能开始孵化过程。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>扳手</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_4a84e305-07b5-4584-b835-4c279596c0f7.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>用于<strong>连接</strong><strong>特斯拉网络</strong>中的组件。顾名思义，<em>迪纳摩</em>（发电机）伙伴是基本电力发生器。如果连接到特斯拉网络组件，它将产生电流。可用于循环设置驯服迪纳摩的攻击模式。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>法师法杖</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_bc149eef-646a-434d-8713-3c0cb097e3e5.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一根魔法魔杖，必须<strong>给予</strong>金发光翼鸟以完成其变身。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>魔法射线书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_77e64754-08aa-4f32-9462-175b03a1b82e.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>向瞄准方向发射魔法光束。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>黑洞书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_fc8726fe-5353-4c59-b926-d3da7d78cadd.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>向瞄准方向发射黑洞。一段时间后，它会锚定在该位置。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>石刺书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_3f8ad120-70b0-4ca5-97fe-1476ce89bfb3.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>生成从地面升起的石刺。可以通过用末地硬币支付给石像鬼获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>冰旋风书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_b38d9dde-fc45-4af6-a1e3-f80ef4e0cafc.png\" width=\"117\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>生成冰旋风，推开附近的实体。可以通过用铜币支付给仆从获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>冰晶书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_8f615ccf-9266-4ffc-8bc3-d17e11b6c4f4.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>创建多个冰晶，沿玩家指向的方向移动。可以通过用铜币支付给仆从获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>治疗光环书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_edabf4d5-2814-4878-8074-bc4370f6f81c.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>治疗光环治疗实体和附近盟友，同时伤害附近的不死敌人。可以通过用末地硬币支付给石像鬼获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>火印书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_6844a2c3-7fa3-4246-8e79-5bdc8a75df41.png\" width=\"132\" height=\"132\"></p>\n<p>生成一个环，接触时施加火印。燃烧标记的实体会导致其爆炸。可以通过用下界硬币支付给驯服的小恶魔获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong> Brace 书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_3b93ae6d-847f-4cbb-bf7c-bb5ae68920df.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>向瞄准方向发射余烬。它在附近的敌对实体之间跳跃。可以通过用下界硬币支付给驯服的小恶魔获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>长柄刀书</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_108ddbb9-8834-4663-b5a9-1286f5071837.png\" width=\"114\" height=\"114\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>召唤几把从天而降的长柄刀，贯穿路径上的一切。制作书籍。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>铜币</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_7325d491-3bed-4b17-9ab5-403417c20fde.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>在<strong>主世界</strong>中发现的基本硬币。可用于激活嘉年华，与科内利乌斯玩耍或获得一些魔法书。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>下界硬币</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_fe7a8cfb-be21-4931-b02e-a6636fd8ff19.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在<strong>下界</strong>中发现的基本硬币。可用于激活嘉年华，与科内利乌斯玩耍或获得一些魔法书。它比铜币更有价值。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>末地硬币</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_9ea90bf9-a3bd-4d75-9537-e918fa6ebe9c.png\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在<strong>末地</strong>中发现的基本硬币。可用于激活嘉年华，与科内利乌斯玩耍或获得一些魔法书。它比下界硬币更有价值。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>下界合金链</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_fdfc86d0-bba4-45b8-a542-ed6b003fece0.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>用于<strong>锁定</strong>驯服仆从的阶段，防止其再次改变变体，避免维度间的相位转移。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>恶魔肉</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_b7e7d544-9797-45b6-acad-5572723eab12.png\" width=\"133\" height=\"133\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>掉落自</strong>一些敌对的下界生物，如恶魂、猪灵和敌对小恶魔。可以<strong>食用</strong>，虽然没有味道。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>旧布</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_b72f8280-2cdc-4577-9604-96866566a780.gif\" width=\"129\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>掉落自</strong>神圣教皇Boss。用于制作。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>遗迹黄金</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_4438900d-6097-4a8c-87f9-309c81705dfa.gif\" width=\"137\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>掉落自</strong>神圣教皇Boss。用于制作。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>鞭子臂</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_eb303a6-9043-4ffa-b417-1ad5248fc31d.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可互换</strong>的木偶手臂。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>突变臂</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_2394db5e-75ac-4d95-8ffc-f89fd4e0acf4.png\" width=\"135\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可互换</strong>的木偶手臂。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>炮管臂</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_c9945042-0412-41a5-8cb6-b2e1eacb1103.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可互换</strong>的木偶手臂。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>刀刃臂</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_6f5cc055-9d51-4ff8-8dee-51cba7bde845.png\" width=\"131\" height=\"131\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可互换</strong>的木偶手臂。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>结晶血</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_c1055486-dc44-4e25-af07-073ab6b09844.png\" width=\"134\" height=\"134\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>用于<strong>充电</strong>祭坛。通过在灵魂熔炉中烹饪腐肉获得。它也用于驯服沙漠中自然发现的野生蚁狮。你必须与其背上的血交互，因为如果它看到玩家，它将进入攻击模式。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>突变肉</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_9cc68dca-46a3-48df-858d-d3cdda11d89e.gif\" width=\"127\" height=\"127\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>特殊的<strong>食物</strong>，通过给突变的泰迪熊喂一桶熔岩获得。如果你看着实体吃它，你会传送到玩家当前位置的相反位置。小心，因为这可能适得其反。可用于某些<strong>制作</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>针</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_9a2d0870-b3cf-4cbb-9c71-b8744405b0dc.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>用于驯服</strong>泰迪熊。它具有巫毒魔法，因此与远处的实体交互会平等减少其实体和玩家的生命值。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>永恒打火机</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_b226b71e-81f6-4b16-94ec-3c6399d84cde.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>用<strong>永恒之火</strong>点燃方块，永不熄灭。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>阴影铃铛</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_fe6b6f38-4cb8-47b9-8a34-0a3fd93dbbd9.png\" width=\"135\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>当与至少有一个电荷的祭坛<strong>交互</strong>时，它将其链接。如果使用此物品，它将生成链接到该祭坛的实体。要使其消失，只需与实体交互即可。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>圣克里姆特唱片</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_254e57d8-bcc8-4990-ac3f-424dce151a8a.png\" width=\"156\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歌曲<em>圣克里姆特</em>的唱片，由<em>Solas Composer</em>作曲。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: verdana;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>灵魂宝石</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_537e0534-172f-4850-ac79-39432a981435.gif\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\"></p>\n<p>一颗内部有灵魂旋转的钻石。通过在灵魂熔炉中烹饪钻石获得。用作制作物品。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/c4BZZNkp/mobs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"409\" height=\"256\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>迪纳摩</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_4e1ea361-e9b0-4ba4-ad08-326466aadfee.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"265\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>迪纳摩</strong>，如其名所示（发电机），是一种自行发电的实体。它不能在野外找到。在突袭期间，掠夺者傀儡可能会生成，击败它有几率产生破损的迪纳摩。你也可以在新结构类型工厂中找到破损的迪纳摩。这个实体必须给予它请求的特定物品来自我修复。一旦恢复，它就变成真正的迪纳摩。默认情况下，它会在半径内攻击敌对实体及其主人的当前目标，你可以用扳手切换其攻击模式。当它坐下时，它充当特斯拉网络组件的发电机。如果连接到其中一个，它将发出电射线，为电路供电。任何无效实体接触到电都会受到电击。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>蚁狮</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_768285d6-5de6-4234-9e8a-56f075101f80.png\" width=\"251\" height=\"156\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_4f68fa6e-093e-4bad-9f3e-2e35b53dbdfc.png\" width=\"154\" height=\"149\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_acba03d7-3b76-43a0-a45a-cd3dca1e2333.png\" width=\"219\" height=\"160\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_faa74398-353f-4299-8b55-fed718e84ce3.png\" width=\"237\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>蚁狮</strong>有四种可能的状态，每天按顺序循环，无限进行。在其基础状态下，它可以潜入地下并通过喷射沙子远程攻击。如果你用剪刀与其交互，你可以剪下其毛发以获得蚁狮毛皮，只有在四个状态完成循环后才会再生。它的第二种状态是蛹，是一个球体，尽管伤害输出低，但可以承受许多攻击。在第三种状态下，它变成成年蚁狮，可以飞行。如果主人骑乘它，他们将获得“滑翔机”，尽管随着距离增加高度会缓慢下降。在第四阶段，蚁狮士兵，它通过向敌人射击沙弹丸进行攻击。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>灵魂法师</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_6522d652-eda3-4da3-88a4-c1d0b930aeb4.png\" width=\"255\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>灵魂法师</strong>不能自然找到。然而，金发光翼鸟可以在沼泽中生成。你可以给这只特殊的发光翼鸟法师的服装（外套和帽子）以及法杖，将其变成灵魂法师。它本身什么都不做，但你可以给它魔法书供其自由使用。如果你在灵魂熔炉中烹饪蜡烛，你会生成活蜡烛。当活蜡烛找到附近的灵魂法师时，它会与其绑定作为其所有者。如果下一次攻击会杀死灵魂法师，活蜡烛会消失，允许灵魂法师幸存。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>羊角面包龙</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_86f4da83-61a2-4994-9817-0d48ddbc42c4.png\" width=\"348\" height=\"206\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>羊角面包龙</strong>是通过孵化羊角面包蛋获得的伙伴，羊角面包蛋是通过在灵魂熔炉中烹饪大面包获得的。你必须喂它三桶牛奶才能让它长大直到可以被驯服。它的攻击不造成伤害，但会减缓敌对生物的速度。如果为其装备 flavored 盔甲套装，奶油蛋糕会赋予其主人正面效果，并对敌对生物施加负面效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>斗篷</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_f671dc43-4a66-4e8d-aab9-58f674335227.png\" width=\"289\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>斗篷</strong>是通过使用旧布与重生图腾交互召唤的伙伴。它可以发射在接触敌人时爆炸的神圣星星，也会追逐其目标。它可以让自己和主人暂时隐身，防止敌对生物看到或攻击他们。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>曼克</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_36026197-5763-4d09-a6ca-72e119953d44.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"234\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>曼克</strong>是通过使用遗迹黄金与重生图腾交互召唤的伙伴。它可以在脚下生成火焰环伤害附近实体，或在一定范围内向其目标发射激光束。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>科内利乌斯</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_c581219-c46d-4384-86c6-418f1c1275d7.png\" width=\"336\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>科内利乌斯</strong>是一种赌场经销商伙伴，自然生成在沼泽中。要驯服它，你必须带一只蜜蜂给它。杀死蜜蜂会将科内利乌斯驯服给最近的玩家。它是一种召唤者类型，意味着它不直接攻击，而是召唤实体为其战斗。要召唤，你给它铜币、下界硬币或末地硬币，每种召唤不同的实体。如果你想的话，你也可以和它玩黑杰克。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>仆从</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_873591b5-cc90-459e-8c48-b1c6c80b8cd3.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"194\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_f8cbe0ee-86e8-4f02-a7b9-f8fdd2da2680.png\" width=\"231\" height=\"200\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_bfc7f663-3e2b-4e4f-a508-3d2a2ff15b9c.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"197\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>仆从</strong>是一种不自然生成的伙伴。它的敌对变体，敌对小恶魔，在下界生成。你可以尝试用硬币驯服它，但如果失败，它将变得具有攻击性并攻击你。它是一种相位转移者，意味着它通过维度改变形态。主世界的仆从，末地的石像鬼和下界的小恶魔。每个变体都有独特的能力。如果你幸运的话，你也可以花费每个变体的相应硬币从它们那里购买魔法书。使用下界合金链锁定其相位，防止其在改变维度时变形。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>木偶</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_5962b512-a350-4111-b91d-51757231f3e5.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"312\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>木偶</strong>是一种不自然生成的伙伴。在女巫小屋这一新结构中，你会发现一个正在扫地魔法手。与其交互会激怒它并触发石头剪刀布游戏。要玩这个游戏，你必须 literally 使用其中一件物品。如果你赢了，它会被驯服为木偶的手。然后你必须对它使用空木偶，最终将其变成木偶。要使其功能正常，你必须给它手臂，这些是可以制作的。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>阴影巨口</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_6d76eaeb-85eb-4cb3-b6e6-e790ab85988e.png\" width=\"289\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>阴影巨口</strong>是使用阴影巨口祭坛和阴影铃铛召唤的临时伙伴。它的主要目的是陆地和水域运输，虽然它也可以咬人。一段时间后它会消失。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>阴影剑</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_e53e2564-0d45-4676-beea-b2d8d9770f8f.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"280\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>阴影剑</strong>是使用阴影剑祭坛和阴影铃铛召唤的临时伙伴。它的目的是战斗。当主人有目标时，剑会钩住它并在周围飞行攻击。一段时间后它会消失。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>泰迪熊</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_23bbc3c7-af80-46b2-b09c-c9ed495b4f25.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"251\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_3a09b84e-dc52-4fee-9534-ea7df24160e7.png\" width=\"278\" height=\"254\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>泰迪熊</strong>是在名为泰迪熊监狱的新结构中发现的伙伴。它可以用针驯服。一旦驯服，它的攻击可以施加巫毒效果，导致附近的受影响实体射出针并将其刺穿。如果用永恒打火机与驯服后的它交互，它会变成其突变的飞行版本。当它有目标时，它会绕圈并撞击它，造成伤害。如果它在攻击时受到重击，它会传送到目标的另一侧。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>金发光翼鸟</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_aaf8a708-7905-4d31-8e5c-5fb6c7a4817a.png\" width=\"230\" height=\"182\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>金发光翼鸟</strong>自然生成在沼泽中，必须给予法师的衣服和魔法法杖才能驯服它并将其变成灵魂法师伙伴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>木偶手套</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_8aa1eaff-2aa9-45c9-8fba-b9ab6ad1e396.png\" width=\"193\" height=\"233\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>木偶手套</strong>是在赢得魔法手套的石头剪刀布游戏后获得的临时伙伴。它自行攻击，但没有其他效果。如果你用空木偶与其交互，它会变成木偶伙伴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>破损的迪纳摩</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_9ad5f1d2-cf3d-44c7-adb7-3995ebdfb71b.png\" width=\"325\" height=\"177\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>破损的迪纳摩</strong>是迪纳摩的损坏版本。一旦修复完成，它就变成迪纳摩伙伴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>敌对小恶魔</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_330be014-285d-4eb9-8db0-b50a0efcd36c.png\" width=\"355\" height=\"298\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>敌对小恶魔</strong>自然生成在下界。默认情况下它是中立的，可以用硬币雇佣（驯服）。如果尝试失败，它将变得具有攻击性并会在一段时间内攻击玩家。如果成功驯服，它会变成仆从伙伴。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>魔法手套</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_7a17c5f3-d6e4-436d-8ef8-ab51f27faa4a.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>魔法手套</strong>在新结构女巫小屋中发现。与其交互会挑战你玩石头剪刀布。赢了会将其驯服为木偶手套。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>掠夺者傀儡</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_fad531f6-5107-4cd9-87a5-395796414c6e.png\" width=\"233\" height=\"292\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>掠夺者傀儡</strong>出现在突袭中，并用带电荷的区域攻击。击败它有几率掉落破损的迪纳摩。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>野生蚁狮</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_faa74398-353f-4299-8b55-fed718e84ce3.png\" width=\"278\" height=\"188\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>野生蚁狮</strong>自然生成在沙漠中。如果它看到你，它会埋入沙子并攻击。要驯服它并获得蚁狮伙伴，你必须从背后接近而不被发现，并使用结晶血与其交互。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: verdana;\"><strong>神圣教皇 - 陛下</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_88181080-b1ef-40f6-9622-3acdc76f524f.png\" width=\"471\" height=\"289\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1300341/description_75abd85d-54a0-46af-b7cb-cd1d2ab7f6ec.png\" width=\"258\" height=\"292\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>神圣教皇</strong>是模组的Boss，在其自己的结构中自然生成。与其交互会打断其祈祷并触发战斗。在第一阶段，它使用各种火焰攻击。击败它将其变成第二阶段陛下，它使用金色的长柄刀进行远程投掷。完全击败它掉落旧布和遗迹黄金。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/668tnYV8/credits.png\" width=\"564\" height=\"384\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Xylonity</strong> - 编程和模组页面设计</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>TheModderG</strong> - 艺术家和模组图标设计</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>stefanbech</strong> - 主要测试者和建造者</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>longsansuisui</strong> - 中文翻译</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>tennythomas1</strong>, <strong>midmilky</strong> - 额外测试者</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Zylonity</strong> - 帮助修复了特斯拉网络中的一个重大bug</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Solas Composer</strong> - 圣克里姆特Boss音乐制作人</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c2df77fd-f653-4280-9d2f-32dd78e03ded.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"124\"></span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>需要一个服务器与朋友一起玩吗？不知道如何设置？只需从BisectHosting租用一个已经配置好的服务器！点击<a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/XYLONITY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">这里</a>，选择计划（至少4GB），并使用我的代码<strong>XYLONITY</strong>获得第一个月25%的折扣，并与你的朋友一起享受游戏！</p>\n</div>",
